WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.853
Step 1. Open Notes. Open the encounter from All Encounters, and select Notes.

1.2
00:00:05.853 --> 00:00:11.446
The screen is the same on the patient's Notes tab and in an encounter.

2.1
00:00:11.446 --> 00:00:16.303
Step 2. Select a discussion. Care opens the newest discussion.

2.2
00:00:16.303 --> 00:00:20.890
Select a title in the Discussions list to open another.

3.1
00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:27.238
Step 3. Read the messages. Messages from others are on the left, yours on the right.

3.2
00:00:27.238 --> 00:00:31.222
Point at a picture to see the author's username.

4.1
00:00:31.222 --> 00:00:35.022
Step 4. Type your message. Type in the message box.

4.2
00:00:35.022 --> 00:00:41.163
You can format the text with Markdown, and press Enter to start a new line.

5.1
00:00:41.163 --> 00:00:47.603
Step 5. Send the message. Select Send message. Care adds your message at the bottom,

5.2
00:00:47.603 --> 00:00:52.597
and others with the discussion open see it within 30 seconds.
